{"title":"순수하지 않은 감각","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=btzj4R/dJMb9MCHxZV/i58isVUuPa1pfhRmMvKrv0&filename=th3","synopsis":"부명그룹의 브레인이자 핵심 TF팀 리더, ‘강태욱’ 수석.\n교육자 부모 아래서 모범적으로 자랐지만, 원하는 것에서 양보는 없었다.\n그런데 지극히 보수적인 그에게 KJ 신기주 대표의 비서\n‘임정은’이란 여자는 자꾸만 낯선 충동을 일으키는데…….\n\n“임정은 씨, 태어나서 해 본 제일 못된 짓이 뭡니까?\n나는 지금 임정은 씨랑 못된 짓 하러 가려고 하거든요.”\n\n순간 뒷덜미에 열기가 확 모이며 귓불이 뜨거워졌다.\n그의 목소리가 너무도 평이해서 도발하는 것처럼 느껴지지는 않았다.\n\n“못된 짓이라……. 그쪽이랑 한 원나잇이요.\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":193,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":251,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":244,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":256,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":261,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":261,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":254,"change":{"type":"